      "id": "claim_158fd2d9b0f14e7ba3b0f1fd1cf33045",
      "statement": "POST /upload offloads the blocking PDF read and LLM CV-keyword extraction to a Celery task (filework) using Redis as broker and result backend, returning a job_id; the client polls GET /jobs/{job_id} for the AsyncResult status, which reports done/pending/failed (an httpx.TimeoutException maps to a friendly slow-CV message).",
