    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c09bb1f839274551b797f96cd95886a8",
      "statement": "POST /askeval is an LLM-free graph entrypoint: it runs the same deterministic graph compiled against an InMemorySaver (eval_agent) and protected by EVALS auth, returning {jobs, md}. eval_runner.py posts to /askeval and then grades the returned listings with an external LLM (Gemini/OpenRouter/Laya) acting as a judge, not as part of the search path.",
