      "statement": "GET /health is the service liveness endpoint: it pings Redis and Celery, returns {status: ok} when either is reachable, and raises HTTP 503 only when Celery has not responded for PING_TIME (90s). Health-check access logs are filtered out of uvicorn's access log.",
